{"abstract":[{"text":"A tuning system in which all twelve keys are usable but have distinct tonal characters,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"achieved by distributing the Pythagorean comma unevenly around the circle of fifths."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","externalID":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"IvorTuning"}],"symbolKind":"struct","title":"WellTemperament","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"WellTemperament"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/UsingIvorTuning"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A well temperament is fully defined by the sizes of its twelve perfect fifths around","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the circle. ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/fifths","type":"reference"},{"text":" maps each ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/Fifth","type":"reference"},{"text":" to its frequency ratio. Any fifth not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present in the map is assumed to be a pure 3:2.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For the tuning to be internally consistent, the product of all twelve fifths must equal","type